=== cc-P1 (kept rule): a WHERE in the main is not the collect form ===
CTE 't' has no aggregate functions and no GROUP BY, so it is only supported as a single-row key lookup: its WHERE clause must bind every primary key column of table 'ev' by equality with a constant.  Otherwise add GROUP BY and aggregate functions to the CTE body.
Error handling: RPE
ronsql_cli caught exception: Non-aggregating CTE body is not a single-row key lookup.

